Subject: [PATCH] fix(a11y): share validated project capability queries
 (LT-190)

Use one typed project query in the matrix and standalone entry. Preserve
independent historical status and deliberate read retries, fail closed on
malformed readiness, and require fresh write capability before dispatch.

